-- "A seller who still has listings cannot close their account", said as a
-- refusal over the request. The listing's seller is required, so a listing
-- holds its seller. The `never` turns away every CloseAccount whose seller is
-- held, and check V24 reads it: ApplyClose only deletes a seller nothing holds.

act Seller {
    name: text
}

act Listing {
    title: text
    seller: one Seller
}

transient act CloseAccount {
    seller: one Seller
}

never (CloseAccount where seller is held)

rule ApplyClose when CloseAccount {
    delete seller
}
